Hippo modifications (this fork)
-------------------------------
Selective retention before context compaction ("Hippo 海马记忆"):
  - src/context/compaction/retention/  (the `hippo-retention` package: scoring
    policy, entity graph, local embedding/BM25 fallback; importable on its own)
  - src/context/compaction/CompactionEngine.ts (opt-in scorePolicy hook)
  - src/pilot/config (agent.compaction.retention switch)
  - tests/context/hippo-retention.spec.ts, tests/context/retention-wiring.spec.ts
  - benchmarks/* (A/B, ablation, tuning, real-LLM closed-loop evaluation)

Optional local embedding model
------------------------------
- Xenova/bge-small-zh-v1.5 (used when PILOTDECK_BGE_MODEL is set)
  https://huggingface.co/Xenova/bge-small-zh-v1.5 — MIT License.
  The model is NOT distributed with this repository; it is fetched or
  provided by the user at runtime. Without it the code falls back to BM25.

Runtime dependencies keep their own licenses; see package.json. This fork
adds no proprietary assets. All benchmark JSON in benchmarks/results/ is
sanitized and contains no API keys.
